# 1.15.9.69722 in .build.info (product "wow_classic_era" -- also the
# exact build this project's data extraction is pinned to, see
# README.md), and Blizzard's Interface-number convention is
# major*10000 + minor*100 + patch, giving 11509. That convention usually
# holds but isn't guaranteed -- confirm with `/dump select(4,
# GetBuildInfo())` in-game and update this if it doesn't match. An
# out-of-date Interface number doesn't stop the addon from loading (with
# "Load out of date AddOns" enabled), it's only used for Blizzard's
# compatibility warning.

